# Expense Tracker Application

# Project Description
This project is a simple Expense Tracker program designed to help users manage their monthly finances. 
The application allows the user to set their monthly income, add expense entries, view all expenses, 
calculate the total expenses, and display the remaining balance. The purpose of the project is to apply 
object-oriented programming concepts, including class design, constructors, methods, and documentation standards.

