### ExpenseEntry – *Genesis Coria*  
Allows adding new expenses, including expense name and amount.

### ExpenseList – *Harrison Usigbe*  
Stores all expense entries and allows viewing the list of expenses.

### ExpenseCalculator – *Bryit Sumner*  
